#
# LF in every checkout, Windows' included (Git for Windows converts to CRLF by
# default): the shell scripts under tool/ run in Git Bash, which does not take
# CRLF, and `dart format` and `cargo fmt --check` see the same bytes on every
# platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
